  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 11th level, the advisor unlocks skill leverage with any skill that he has at least 1 rank in. Additionally, the advisor’s skill leverage pool increases by 2, and whenever the advisor would spend more than 1 use of skill leverage (including when spending them on an allies behalf), he reduces its cost by 1 (minimum 1 use of skill leverage).</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/advisor#toc34\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
